head: { text: "Pipelined shared bus: core 1 (u_core0) load granted in C1, core 2 (u_core1) store granted in C2" },
foot: { text: "1 ns per step, 50 MHz clock. Macro timing: OCD 3.3 V worst corner. Logic delays: estimates." },
